online activity outside of X, such as the websites you visit, to personalize your experience.\"),o(\"c981a36c\",\"Allow X to personalize your experience with your inferred activity, e.g. activity on devices you haven’t used to log in to X.\"),o(\"eb0cc786\",\"Allow sharing of additional information with X’s business partners.\"),o(\"dd533318\",\"Manage the location information X uses to personalize your experience.\"),o(\"bd0646a0\",\"Learn more about privacy on X\"),o(\"a607862a\",\"Privacy policy\"),o(\"g5925628\",\"Contact us\"),o(\"dd6012f8\",\"Privacy center\"),o(\"f644b748\",\"Manage who can reply to your posts and your filtered replies.\"),o(\"ff4b3818\",\"Grok & Third-party Collaborators\"),o(\"i586f3e0\",\"Allow your public data as well as your interactions, inputs, and results with Grok and xAI to be used for training and fine-tuning\"),o(\"df3171d4\",\"Manage the location associated with your account\"),o(\"d8492604\",\"When selected, your posts and other account information are only visible to people who follow you.\"),o(\"if050fae\",\"Protect your videos\"),o(\"b7ed5f6e\",\"If selected, videos in your posts will not be downloadable by default. This setting applies to posts going forward and is not retroactive\"),o(\"dbb51952\",\"Protect your posts?\"),o(\"de735de6\",\"This will make them visible only to your X followers.\"),o(\"c5d4192a\",\"Protect\"),o(\"d9ddba70\",\"Communities are public, so protecting your account will hide your previous posts. You also won’t be able to post in the Community until your account is public again.\"),o(\"f527b322\",\"Protect my account\"),o(\"d165c992\",\"Anyone can tag you\"),o(\"ea339390\",\"Only people you follow can tag you\"),o(\"e3a761ee\",\"Off\"),o(\"d3a2bde8\",\"See information about your account, download an archive of your data, or learn about your account deactivation options\"),o(\"idca4742\",\"See your account information like your phone number and email address.\"),o(\"b6ded35e\",\"Change your password at