at helped a note reach the status of Not Helpful\"),o(\"d46b6bc8\",\"These ratings improve Community Notes by giving feedback to note authors, and allowing contributors to focus on the most promising notes.\"),o(\"a5e6ba6a\",\"Ratings of Helpful on notes that ended up with a status of Not Helpful\"),o(\"a22929e4\",\"Ratings of Not Helpful on notes that ended up with a status of Helpful\"),o(\"b76dd726\",'These ratings are common and can lead to status changes if enough people agree that a \"Helpful\" note isn’t sufficiently helpful.'),o(\"j29cc0f2\",\"These ratings are counted twice because they often indicate support for notes that others deemed low-quality.\"),o(\"cd4333d0\",\"Don’t worry, everyone gets some of these! \"),o(\"e9fa53ac\",\"Ratings on notes that don’t currently have a status of Helpful or Not Helpful.\"),o(\"fc664dee\",\"Ratings made after a status was reached\"),o(\"f024ec64\",\"These ratings can strengthen a note’s status, or help overturn it.\"),o(\"e1ee08e6\",\"Writing impact\"),o(\"je3fc324\",\"Your notes that earned the status of Helpful\"),o(\"f7358242\",\"Notes that earned the status of Helpful\"),o(\"j8e9b514\",\"Well done! These notes are now showing to everyone who sees the post, adding context and helping keep people informed.\"),o(\"e9e57c5c\",\"These notes are now showing to everyone who sees the post, adding context and helping keep people informed.\"),o(\"fee0d8a8\",\"These notes get shown on X, adding context to posts and helping keep people informed.\"),o(\"iab44364\",\"Your notes that reached the status of Not Helpful\"),o(\"d8c90438\",\"Notes that reached the status of Not Helpful\"),o(\"accaa48e\",`These notes have been rated Not Helpful by enough contributors, including those who sometimes disagree in their past ratings. You can see these notes and the feedback they’ve received on your profile.\nNote statuses can change as more people rate them.`),o(\"fa2156f6\",`These notes have been rated Not Helpful by enough contributors, including those who sometimes disagree in their past ratings.\nNote statuses can change as more people rate them.`),o(\"d004c768\",\"Notes that need more ratings\"),o(\"f3d6d6c0\",\"Notes that don’t yet have a status of Helpful or Not Helpful.\"),o(\"d68a370c\",\"Last update: \"),o(\"f10aaf3c\",\"Note rating tips\"),o(\"b9793c9a\",\"You haven’t written any notes yet\"),o(\"bed66f92\",\"Here’s how to start:\"),o(\"a3ca686a\",\"See tips for writing helpful notes\"),o(\"ga8034c6\",\"Tap the ••• menu on any post to write a note\"),o(\"h4109636\",\"If you think a post is potentially misleading, write a note that adds helpful context to people who may encounter it.\"),o(\"ec30e9ac\",\"Other contributors will rate the helpfulness of your note\"),o(\"e0c42f80\",\"If it reaches a status of Helpful, it will be shown as context to everyone who sees the post\"),o(\"ife4baaa\",\"Community Notes doesn’t work by majority rule. To identify notes that are helpful to a wide range of people, statuses require agreement between contributors who have sometimes disagreed in their past ratings. This helps prevent one-sided ratings.\"),o(\"a0c552ee\",\"Your impact will be shown here\"),o(\"a4e5ea3c\",\"You haven’t rated any notes yet\"),o(\"g9a28bde\",\"Browse notes that need help\"),o(\"dc0046e2\",\"Browse the Community Notes home\"),o(\"fecae168\",\"There, you’ll find notes that need more ratings, and where your rating specifically can help.\"),o(\"h525e29e\",\"Help find notes that could be helpful to many people\"),o(\"f6db7706\",\"The best Community Notes directly address the post’s claim, are written in helpful and clear language, and add sources that a wide range of people would find reliable.\"),o(\"f636b582\",\"Help find notes that aren’t helpful\"),o(\"f58f4f62\",\"Rating low quality notes improves Community Notes by giving feedback to note authors, and allowing contributors to focus on the most promising notes.\"),o(\"cf30af22\",\"Did you know?\"),o(\"d145b0fa\",\"Note statuses aren’t reached by majority rule. To identify notes that are helpful to a wide range of people, note statuses require agreement between contributors who have sometimes disagreed in their past ratings. This helps prevent one-sided ratings.\"),o(\"c20a24cc\",\"Congratulations!\"),o(\"d01b8fc8\",\"You’re a top Community Notes writer.\"),o(\"jbe2ad46\",\"Writers with a high Writing Impact and a high proportion of notes with a status of “Helpful” get access to:\"),o(\"d2dc3d4c\",\"Priority for note alerts\"),o(\"heb73816\",\"Top Writers’ note proposals are more likely to trigger notifications to get rater’s attention.\"),o(\"b760d51a\",\"Badge in alias profile\"),o(\"ief63e50\",\"Top Writers can be identified by a badge in their Community Notes profile.\"),o(\"jd6b88ca\",\"Notes about media\"),o(\"c39bdf5a\",\"Top Writers can write notes about media featured on multiple posts, keeping many more people better informed.\"),o(\"d8361d0a\",\"Suggestion on a Collaborative Note\"),o(\"jba34c04\",\"View feedback\"),o(\"c393f116\",\"Suggestion incorporated\"),o(\"e5d18abe\",\"Suggestion not incorporated\"),o(\"ac9c3858\",\"Suggestion is awaiting feedback\"),o(\"efb9a9e0\",\"Nothing to see here\"),o(\"a1529ce7\",\"Learn more\"),o(\"f07ed596\",\"Contributors like you collectively help identify Helpful notes to be shown as context on X and keep people informed.\"),o(\"h2b5268a\",\"Well done! Rate more notes to continue growing your impact.\"),o(\"e86c87a0\",\"Rate more notes\"),o(\"ad98f836\",\"Your Rating Impact went negative. Don’t worry!\"),o(\"e2d7c914\",\"Continue rating notes\"),o(\"a5427624\",\"Browse the Community Notes home to find notes that need ratings from more contributors.\"),o(\"e227a7fa\",\"Note statuses can always change\"),o(\"eda73c9c\",\"Your ratings will, sometimes, disagree with the status on a note. That’s not a problem! If more contributors agree with you, the status can be overturned, and your impact will change.\"),o(\"cfa3b664\",\"You can now write Community Notes!\"),o(\"j44125ee\",\"This contributor hasn’t written any notes yet.\"),o(\"da55067c\",\"Check this space later!\"),o(\"a123a58a\",\"Learn more about suggestions\"),o(\"had43d26\",\"This contributor hasn’t written any suggestions yet.\"),o(\"ba17d826\",\"Once you unlock the ability to write notes, you can earn the ability to suggest improvements on notes, too.\"),o(\"cbfd875c\",\"Unlock the ability to suggest improvements on notes\"),o(\"f5acb6f5\",function(e){return\"Once your Writing Impact reaches \"+e.cutoff+\" or higher, you’ll be able to suggest improvements on notes.\"}),o(\"f260c0ff\",function(e){return\"Once your Rating Impact reaches \"+e.cutoff+\" or higher, you’ll be able to suggest improvements on notes.\"}),o(\"c27db2e8\",\"You can suggest improvements on notes!\"),o(\"f893c3b8\",\"Join Community Notes\"),o(\"a701795c\",\"No Community Notes yet\"),o(\"db08295e\",\"Want to join?\"),o(\"ha275800\",\"Looks like you’re not a part of the Community Notes pilot program. Join now to help people stay better informed.\"),o(\"ce0a213a\",\"To create a note, select the Community Notes icon in any post’s menu. Notes you create will show up here.\"),o(\"c87f3cf8\",\"Note\"),o(\"a5b19492\",\"This note does not exist\"),o(\"c21d1b2a\",\"Notes reach a status of Helpful or Not Helpful once there is agreement from enough contributors, including people who have sometimes disagreed in their past ratings. This helps ensure notes are helpful to a wide range of people, and prevents one-sided ratings.\"),o(\"c7b59cde\",\"Community Notes settings\"),o(\"c20d0df5\",\"Find out more.\"),o(\"a4293384\",\"Current version\"),o(\"i5bc774a\",\"Previous versions\"),o(\"cb491d96\",\"No previous revisions\"),o(\"fb4ae7d0\",\"Loading revision history\"),o(\"ae2c3e0a\",\"This revision history does not exist\"),o(\"d19ba24e\",\"This note does not have revision history\"),o(\"a48a6d9a\",\"Suggestion feedback\"),o(\"j6407c18\",\"Suggestion\"),o(\"c8e6202c\",\"Original note version\"),o(\"